# The brag skill installs itself twice, byte for byte. Track the .claude copy,
# which is the one this project's agent reads, and leave the mirror on disk
# without carrying a second 17MB of bundled audio in the repo.
/.agents/skills/brag/

# Regenerable review frames from `hyperframes check --snapshots`.
/brag-output/*/snapshots/
